# Exception: 10KB brand stinger SFX shipped with the repo so every
# deploy has the audio for hook_thumbnail intros (task #202, 2026-08-18).
!genlab-core/assets/audio/*.mp3

# Exception: ~470KB AI-generated seed music beds shipped with the
# repo so every deploy has at least one music bed per niche for the
# transformation_orchestrator's music_mood dimension (task #206,
# 2026-08-18). Filename convention: ai_generated_seed.mp3.
!*/assets/music_beds/*/ai_generated_seed.mp3
!BlackboxBrief/assets/music_beds/**/ai_generated_seed.mp3
!CriticalRush/niches/gaming/assets/music_beds/**/ai_generated_seed.mp3
!ClutchWire/assets/music_beds/**/ai_generated_seed.mp3
!SpliceReel/assets/music_beds/**/ai_generated_seed.mp3
!FrameDrift/assets/music_beds/**/ai_generated_seed.mp3

# Generated cleanup scripts and BFG history-rewrite artifacts
CLEANUP_PLAN.sh
..bfg-report/

# Trained ML model artifacts (regenerable from train_hook_classifier.py)
genlab-core/models/
deploy/.deploy.log

# .audit/ — 9-phase audit workspace, un-ignored 2026-07-24 (Phase 8.2)
# after the F-0024/F-0045/F-0048 port-5432 exposure was closed. Do not
# re-ignore without redacting security-relevant findings first.

# Approved render deliverables: source frames, SAM2 mattes, models, mp4s.
# 771 MB and growing, and NOT tracked -- but it was never ignored either, so a
# stray `git add -A` would have committed all of it. Each dir carries a
# manifest.json (scripts/archive_deliverable.py) recording sha256s and how to
# reproduce the render; that manifest, not git, is the integrity check.
.deliverables/

# ── CLEAN-01: the repo root is not a screenshot folder ──────────────────────
# 94 setup captures accumulated at the top level over months, none referenced.
# Agent sessions write captures to .audit/screenshots/<date>/ instead.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.log
/*.db
/*.bak
/*.bak.*
.audit/screenshots/
.backups/

# baseline_compare.sh worktrees — created under the repo, removed by cleanup(),
# and pinned to be gone. Never in $HOME: a harness that creates things in the
# home directory is creating them in the wrong place.
/.bc-base/
/.bc-head/

# belt app sources live in the repo (CLEAN-03 §3): the directory had no git
# history and no README of its own, so by the packet's own test it is GenLab
# tooling rather than an independently published project. 26 app sources that
# were version-controlled nowhere now are. Build and venv dirs are not.
belt-apps/*/.infsh/
belt-apps/*/.venv/
belt-apps/*/input.json
.audit/scratch-archive/

# The matte worker lives in the repo (CLEAN-03 §2); its venv and model weights
# do not. 1.1G of venv and a 309MB SAM2 checkpoint are fetched, not authored --
# the checkpoint by the curl in sam2_backend.py's FileNotFoundError message.
# GitHub rejects the checkpoint outright at 100MB, which is how this was found.
worker/.venv/
worker/checkpoints/
